'''Pest Repellent MAX''' is a {{Rare}} item.

== Obtaining ==
'''Pest Repellent MAX''' can be purchased from [[SkyMart]] for {{Item|Pest Repellent|amount=1}} and {{Copper|25}}.

== Usage ==
'''Pest Repellent MAX''' can be consumed to reduce [[Pest]] spawn rates by {{Green|4x}} for {{Green|60}} minutes. It does not reduce {{stat|Bonus Pest Chance}}.

Upon consuming, it gives the player the Pest Repellent II potion effect.

